#ASSERT `s 490.81(1) the judge or justice may appoint a person to manage the property and require its possessor to give possession` FALSE `s 490.81(1) the Attorney General` `s 490.81(1) offence-related property seized under section 487` `s 490.81(1) a justice` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- seized under 487: a judge or justice
#ASSERT `s 490.81(1) the judge or justice may appoint a person to manage the property and require its possessor to give possession` FALSE `s 490.81(1) another person with the written consent of the Attorney General` `s 490.81(1) offence-related property seized under section 487` `s 490.81(1) a judge` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 490.81(1) the judge or justice may appoint a person to manage the property and require its possessor to give possession` FALSE `s 490.81(1) the Attorney General` `s 490.81(1) offence-related property restrained under section 490.8` `s 490.81(1) a judge` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- restrained under 490.8: a judge
#ASSERT `s 490.81(1) the judge or justice may appoint a person to manage the property and require its possessor to give possession` FALSE `s 490.81(1) the Attorney General` `s 490.81(1) offence-related property restrained under section 490.8` `s 490.81(1) a justice` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- a justice may not act for property restrained under 490.8
#ASSERT `s 490.81(1) the judge or justice may appoint a person to manage the property and require its possessor to give possession` TRUE `s 490.81(1) the Attorney General` `s 490.81(1) offence-related property seized under section 487` `s 490.81(1) a judge` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- a controlled substance or cannabis
#ASSERT `s 490.81(1) the judge or justice may appoint a person to manage the property and require its possessor to give possession` FALSE `s 490.81(1) another person without that consent` `s 490.81(1) offence-related property seized under section 487` `s 490.81(1) a judge` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- another person needs the Attorney General's written consent
#ASSERT `s 490.81(1) the judge or justice may appoint a person to manage the property and require its possessor to give possession` FALSE `s 490.81(1) the Attorney General` `s 490.81(1) offence-related property seized under section 487` `s 490.81(1) a judge` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- the judge is not of the opinion that the circumstances so require
#ASSERT `s 490.81(1) the judge or justice may appoint a person to manage the property and require its possessor to give possession` FALSE `s 490.81(1) the Attorney General` `s 490.81(1) other property` `s 490.81(1) a judge` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

#ASSERT `s 490.81(2) the judge or justice shall appoint the Minister of Public Works and Government Services` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 490.81(2) the judge or justice shall appoint the Minister of Public Works and Government Services` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the text gives no time for the act, so the trace has no WITHIN; the party does the act: expected FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 490.81(2) the duty of a judge` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `a judge` DOES `s 490.81(2) appoint the Minister of Public Works and Government Services` AT 1

#ASSERT `s 490.81(3) the power to manage or otherwise deal with property includes the power` `s 490.81(3)(a) the power to make an interlocutory sale of perishable or rapidly depreciating property` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 490.81(3) the power to manage or otherwise deal with property includes the power` `s 490.81(3)(b) the power to destroy, in accordance with subsections (4) to (7), property that has little or no value` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 490.81(3) the power to manage or otherwise deal with property includes the power` `s 490.81(3)(c) the power to have property, other than real property or a conveyance, forfeited to Her Majesty in accordance with subsection (7.1)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 490.81(3) the power to manage or otherwise deal with property includes the power` `s 490.81(3) another power` EQUALS NOTHING

#ASSERT `s 490.81(4) the person appointed to manage property shall apply to a court for a destruction order` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 490.81(4) the person appointed to manage property shall apply to a court for a destruction order` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the text gives no time for the act, so the trace has no WITHIN; the party does the act: expected FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 490.81(4) the duty of a person appointed to manage property` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `s 490.81(4) a person appointed to manage property` DOES `s 490.81(4) apply to a court for a destruction order` AT 1

#ASSERT `s 490.81(5) the court shall require notice to be given` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 490.81(5) the court shall require notice to be given` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the text gives no time for the act, so the trace has no WITHIN; the party does the act: expected FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 490.81(5) the duty of the court` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the court` DOES `s 490.81(5) require notice in accordance with subsection (6) to be given to the person` AT 1

#ASSERT `s 490.81(6) the notice is as the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 490.81(6) the notice is as the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- without: (a) the notice is given in the manner that the court directs or that may be specified in t
#ASSERT `s 490.81(6) the notice is as the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- without: (b) the notice specifies the effective period of the notice that the court considers reaso

#ASSERT `s 490.81(7) the court shall order that the property be destroyed` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- ground 1 of 1 alone
#ASSERT `s 490.81(7) the court shall order that the property be destroyed` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- the court is not satisfied of any ground
-- the text gives no time for the order, so the trace has no WITHIN; the court makes the order: expected FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 490.81(7) the duty of the court` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the court` DOES `s 490.81(7) order that the property be destroyed` AT 1

#ASSERT `s 490.81(7.1) the court shall order the property forfeited to Her Majesty` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 490.81(7.1) the court shall order the property forfeited to Her Majesty` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- without: the application is made by a person who is appointed to manage the property
#ASSERT `s 490.81(7.1) the court shall order the property forfeited to Her Majesty` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- without: the property is not real property or a conveyance
#ASSERT `s 490.81(7.1) the court shall order the property forfeited to Her Majesty` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- without: (a) a notice is given or published in the manner that the court directs or that may be spe
#ASSERT `s 490.81(7.1) the court shall order the property forfeited to Her Majesty` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- without: (b) the notice specifies a period of 60 days during which a person may make an application
#ASSERT `s 490.81(7.1) the court shall order the property forfeited to Her Majesty` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- without: (c) during that period, no one makes such an application
#TRACE `s 490.81(7.1) the duty of the court to order the forfeiture` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the court` DOES `s 490.81(7.1) order that the property be forfeited to Her Majesty to be disposed of or otherwise dealt with in accordance with the law` AT 1

